Z||000005||p4n1c||12-22-2000||08:30 AM||||Thank you for this good laugh in the morning.  I read some of the comments after the story, oh man were they hilarious.  <P>I want to know how stupid people like that can be born, like is it planned?  Is it a certain quota that must be maintained?  Intelligent curteous people like us vs. Unintelligent pricks like him.<P>Sure when I was his age I would brag it up about some guy I raced, but you might cut the car down, but you don't cut the people driving them down.  That's just rude and ignorant, especially when you don't know the person.<P>I think some people on the forum should find where he lives and put him in his place with a nice friendly race.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>And his comment about totally stock?  Then him going on about modifications?  Did I miss something?  I don't think he was talking about another car.<P>Oh well, thanks for getting the brain warmed up today.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>p4n1c<BR>Come out swingin'||||reg||10
