Z||000007||Oreif||12-22-2000||09:33 AM||||My question is: If he didn't even know that Fiero's are american made, Does he know the difference between a coupe and a GT? A V-8 T-bird without the SC is an 8.6 seconds 0-60 car. A 4-cyl Fiero is around 10 seconds 0-60. Given 4 morons in the bird, I'll bet they were racing a "Duke" Fiero and losing by 1-1 1/2 car length's to a V-8 is damn good!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>If you read thru the comments there's a guy who says his Dad's V-8 Fiero does 0-60 in 2.5 seconds   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> Must be one of those special V-8's. You know, 500 c.i., supercharger, runs on race fuel, wrinkle wall slicks, fiberglass body, one seat, wheelie bars, etc<BR>Sold it to get married? (Oh, there are my boots, I'll need them the next time I visit that site.)<P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 12-22-2000).]||||reg||1
